<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88222" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπαλ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prominent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Gym.</u>
					25
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Adam.
				<u>Phgn.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>, v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Musc.Enc.</u>
				3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάρυγξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Gym.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγεῖα</span> (blood-vessels)
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπαλέστατα</span> prob. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. προπαλειότητα</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.Mus.</u>
				58.78
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.</span> the <i>presenting
				part</i> in obstetrics, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.64
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			, <i>more to the front,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γένειον προπαλέστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.138
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λῶς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαψιλῶς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
